# fleet-dao 的 nft 表（/etc/fleet-dao/nftables.nft）：Temporal、库、驾驶舱后端的端口在本机只许 root 和 fleet 连。
# deploy/france.sh 装到 /etc/systemd/system/；改这份、再跑一遍装机脚本，别在机器上手改。停掉它就是撤掉这张表。
[Unit]
Description=fleet-dao 的 nft 表：Temporal、库、驾驶舱后端只许 root 和 fleet 连
Documentation=https://github.com/thoerwink8/fleet-dao/blob/main/docs/ops.md
DefaultDependencies=no
Wants=network-pre.target
Before=network-pre.target shutdown.target fleet-temporal.service postgresql.service
Conflicts=shutdown.target

[Service]
Type=oneshot
RemainAfterExit=yes
ExecStart=/usr/sbin/nft -f /etc/fleet-dao/nftables.nft
ExecReload=/usr/sbin/nft -f /etc/fleet-dao/nftables.nft
ExecStop=/usr/sbin/nft delete table inet fleet_dao

[Install]
WantedBy=multi-user.target
